WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two important signals arrive nearly together.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In laboratory letter streams, identifying the first can impair report of the second.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Yet sometimes the immediately following target is spared.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
That surprise challenges simple explanations.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Intensive training research examined attention but did not test commercial audio.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the source, question the promise and make your own decision.
